{"version":1,"content":"<p>今年金馬獎主席張震原本頒發最佳改編劇本獎，沒想到舞台上突然出現2大荷里活影星身影，舞台上螢幕突然播放荷里活電影《沙丘》的片段，之後沒想到主演的「蜘蛛女」Zendaya、「水行俠」Jason Momoa為金馬秘密拍下短片，Jason Momo</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T15:23:50.990207+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T13:30:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T15:17:13.860179+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T15:17:13.860179+00:00","content_hash":"d487e718ac0259e29a2dea538e9d55c2a907a0363375ea235665f6d0d5600993","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}